{"unit_id":"changlianxiya-139__dsh-ambiguity-handling#card-zh","repo":"changlianxiya-139/dsh-ambiguity-handling","commit":"a47dfc9fb3c23aebbb4fb612a833b48bb5f7950c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ambiguity-handling 是一个适用于 DSH Web 与 headless 配置的提示词插件。它通过 systemPrompt 注入点注册名为 ambiguity-handling、顺序为 50 的独立 section，并追加一组歧义处理规则。规则要求模型在请求含糊或范围不清时明确指出歧义，列出二至四种可能的中文理解，提供“其他”选项，并请用户选择或补充说明。它适合希望 DSH 在开始处理模糊请求前先询问用户、减少臆测的使用场景。插件不声明 API 密钥、账号或外部运行服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:5","index.js:24-29"]}
{"unit_id":"changlianxiya-139__dsh-ambiguity-handling#card-en","repo":"changlianxiya-139/dsh-ambiguity-handling","commit":"a47dfc9fb3c23aebbb4fb612a833b48bb5f7950c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ambiguity-handling adds an ordered section through DSH’s systemPrompt injection point. For unclear requests, its rules ask the model to identify ambiguity, list interpretations, offer an “Other” option, and ask the user to clarify before proceeding. No API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:5","index.js:24-29"]}
