{"unit_id":"changlianxiya-139__dsh-ambiguity-handling#feature-1","repo":"changlianxiya-139/dsh-ambiguity-handling","commit":"a47dfc9fb3c23aebbb4fb612a833b48bb5f7950c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ambiguity-handling 的功能「interpretations」：请求出现歧义或范围不清时，规则要求模型指出含糊之处，并列出二至四种可能的中文理解，帮助用户看清需要确认的选项。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:9-12"]}
